  - { name: "Area of Expertise: Gunman", description: "Special Area of Expertise, chosen at creation (printed 60). A dead shot with revolvers and rifles of all kinds: one extra melee attack when using one of those two weapon types (automatic and energy pistols do not count), no penalties for shooting while moving (running, riding, driving), and +1 to strike in every modern weapon mode (Aimed, Burst, Wild) with revolvers and rifles. Or, if the G.M. allows it, the Gunfighter abilities W.P. Paired Weapons: Revolvers, W.P. Sharpshooting: Revolvers and Rifles, and Quick Draw Initiative: Revolvers & Rifles from Rifts New West page 91 instead. Nothing is applied on the sheet; every part depends on the weapon in hand." }
